    <string name="rivals_title">Best Rivals</string>
    <string name="rivals_info">Rivals are ordered by a score. A higher score means a tougher rival.\nEverything counts only on tables where you played with that rival.\nThe score adds points for each of these numbers:\n• %1$d for each \"Ahead of you\": a table where the rival finished above you.\n• %2$d for each \"Deal-in\": a hand that you discarded and the rival won.\n• %3$d for each \"Self-draw\": a hand that the rival won by self-draw.\n• %4$d for each \"Third party deal-in\": a hand that the rival won on the discard of another player, not yours.\nThe sum is divided by the shared tables so a rival is not first only because you met often.</string>
